// Paw & Claw - Unit Definitions
// Stats based on Advance Wars 2: Black Hole Rising
//
// Unit roster: key (stable ID used in code and saves) -> display name -> AW2 equivalent
// Display names follow the medieval woodland theme; see assets/sprites/manifest.json
//
//   scout         Militia      -> Infantry
//   shocktrooper  Halberdier   -> Mech
//   recon         Outrider     -> Recon
//   ironclad      Charger      -> Tank
//   juggernaut    Warbeast     -> Md Tank
//   behemoth      Colossus     -> Neotank
//   flak          Hawkbane     -> Anti-Air
//   siege         Catapult     -> Artillery
//   barrage       Trebuchet    -> Rockets
//   stinger       Skylance     -> Missiles
//   carrier       Caravan      -> APC
//   supplier      Supply Cart  -> APC (with resupply)
//   ferrier       Skyferry     -> T Copter
//   skywing       Hawk Rider   -> B Copter
//   raptor        Sky Knight   -> Fighter
//   talon         Bombardier   -> Bomber
//   barge         Raft         -> Lander
//   frigate       Galley       -> Cruiser
//   lurker        Diver        -> Sub
//   dreadnought   Flagship     -> Battleship

